        "text": "An OpenZeppelin repo now ships deployable post-quantum account verifiers (Falcon-512 with three hash variants; one spec-compliant, two cheaper). A spec-compliant Falcon-512 account has already executed a mainnet transfer for roughly $0.06, and OZ docs cover migrating an existing account to Falcon keys at the same address. A contributor on X says the provably.fast challenge ideas fed the gas optimizations.",
